<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-INDIA 346 V WEST INDIES (427) IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 346 V WEST INDIES (427) IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were all out for 346 in reply to West Indies first innings of 427 on the fourth day of the first test at Sabina Park on Sunday.</p>
</text>
